#: defsystem.md:2
msgid "Planar 7-Atoms Cluster"
msgstr "平面7原子 Cluster"

#: defsystem.md:4
msgid ""
"Let's consider a simple system formed by seven atoms with Lennard-Jones (LJ)"
" interactions in a planar space. This simple model is presented in the "
"exercise 9 of the [Plumed Masterclass 21.2](https://www.plumed-"
"tutorials.org/lessons/21/002/data/NAVIGATION.html). This LJ cluster has "
"several stable isomers (Figure 1), which can be distinguished in a space of "
"the CVs second (SCM) and third (TCM) central moments of the distribution of "
"coordinations (orange stars in Figure 2)."
msgstr ""
"平面の7 Lennard-Jones (LJ) 原子を考えます。[PLUMED Masterclass "
"21.2](https://www.plumed-tutorials.org/lessons/21/002/data/NAVIGATION.html) "
"の演習9のモデルです。複数の安定 Isomer（図1）を、Coordination 分布の SCM・TCM で区別します（図2の橙の星）。"

#: defsystem.md:15
msgid ""
"**Figure 1.** Local minima isomers of the LJ cluster used in this tutorial."
msgstr "**図1。** 使用する LJ Cluster の局所極小 Isomer。"

#: defsystem.md:17
msgid ""
"The n-th central moment, $\\mu_n$, of the coordination number of an N-atoms "
"cluster is defined as"
msgstr "N 原子 Cluster の Coordination Number の n 次 Central Moment $\\mu_n$ は、"

#: defsystem.md:29
msgid ""
"where $\\left< {X} \\right>$ is the mean value of $X_i$, which is the "
"coordination of the i-th atom,"
msgstr "$\\left< {X} \\right>$ は i 番目の Coordination $X_i$ の平均です。"

#: defsystem.md:40
msgid ""
"with $r_{ij}$ the distance between atoms $i$ and $j$, and $d$ a reference "
"parameter. For this example, d is fixed to 1.5 $\\sigma$, in LJ units."
msgstr "$r_{ij}$ は原子 $i$・$j$ 間距離、$d$ は参照値です。ここでは LJ 単位で1.5 $\\sigma$ に固定します。"

